# Copy to .env for local runs (ntn workers exec --local reads it automatically).
# For the deployed worker, upload with `ntn workers env push` after deploy
# (or set individually: ntn workers env set KEY=value).
#
# .env is gitignored — never commit real keys.
#
# THE BASE TEMPLATE NEEDS NO KEYS AT ALL. USPTO search and TMview are
# keyless — set your owner name(s) in src/config.ts and deploy. Everything
# below upgrades the worker incrementally, each independently.

# ── Owner name(s) to track (optional override) ──────────────────────────
# Normally set in src/config.ts (`ownerNames`). To override without editing
# code, set a comma-separated list here (e.g. "Acme Corporation,Acme LLC").
# PORTFOLIO_OWNERS=

# ── USPTO TSDR (optional upgrade for US rows) ───────────────────────────
# Adds same-day status freshness and enables the file-wrapper document
# tools (office actions, specimens, registration certificates). Free key
# from the USPTO API portal (https://account.uspto.gov/api-manager/).
# Read at RUN time: setting it upgrades the next cycle, no redeploy.
# TSDR_API_KEY=

# ── Counsel Docket Inbox (optional; config.sources.counselDocket) ───────
# The Notion page whose .xlsx attachments are your outside counsel's
# docket/properties reports. Accepts a page ID or full page URL. The
# NOTION_API_TOKEN must belong to an integration that can READ that page
# (page → Connections) — and, for the refreshMarkImages tool, write to the
# portfolio database.
# DOCKET_INBOX_PAGE_ID=
# NOTION_API_TOKEN=

# Set to 1 to deliberately accept a docket ingestion the guards would
# refuse (a portfolio that shrank >40%, or a docket report with zero
# actions in its window).
# DOCKET_ALLOW_SHRINK=

# ── IP Australia (optional; config.sources.ipAustralia) ─────────────────
# Official AU overlay. Free developer account at
# https://portal.api.ipaustralia.gov.au — subscribe to the Australian
# Trade Mark Search API.
# IPA_CLIENT_ID=
# IPA_CLIENT_SECRET=

# ── EUIPO (optional; config.sources.euipo) ──────────────────────────────
# Official EU overlay. Register at https://dev.euipo.europa.eu and
# subscribe to the Trademark Search API. NOTE: tokens are issued even
# BEFORE your subscription is approved — data calls 403 until approval,
# so Sync Health stays red. The source throws instead of recording an empty
# success; resilience preserves any prior valid overlay, and otherwise the
# affected rows retain their TMview baseline until approval.
# EUIPO_CLIENT_ID=
# EUIPO_CLIENT_SECRET=

# ── Your e-billing / spend system (optional) ────────────────────────────
# See src/sources/spend.example.ts.
# SPEND_CLIENT_ID=
# SPEND_CLIENT_SECRET=

# ── Operator escape hatch (see README "Runbook") ────────────────────────
# Comma-separated source keys allowed to serve beyond-cap snapshots during
# an extended outage (e.g. "tmview"). UNSET IT when the outage ends.
# STALENESS_CAP_EXEMPT=
